	measure 'Total Loan Exposure' = ```
			
			    CALCULATE(
			        SUM('gold fact_loan'[LoanAmount]),
			        CROSSFILTER('gold dim_account'[AccountID],'gold fact_loan'[AccountID],Both),
			        CROSSFILTER('gold dim_account'[DistrictID],'gold dim_district'[DistrictID],Both)
			    )
			    
			```
